{
  "slug": "scaffold",
  "name": "Scaffold",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The only Claude Code framework with persistent memory backed by Obsidian. Every session\nresumes where you left off — no recap, no context loss. Includes 17 skills:\n\nmulti-agent\ndecision enforcement (research + debate agents with permanent Architecture Decision Log),\n3-tier model routing (~75% token savings by routing Haiku for search, Sonnet for code,\nOpus for architecture), workflow gates, TDD enforcement, systematic debugging, and\ncontext recovery tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **24 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (24): `agents-md` (Generate or update an AGENTS.md file — universal AI agent instructions that work with Claude Code, Cursor, GitHub…), `consolidate` (Learning pipeline — scans MISTAKE_LOG.md, promotes repeated failures (N≥2) to ANTI_PATTERNS.md, injects approved rules into CLAUDE.md critical tier), `context-save` (Save current session state before context window compaction), `debug-systematic` (4-phase systematic debugging with 3-failure escalation), `decide` (Deploy research + debate agents to make the best coding/architecture decision — scales agent count to decision size,…), `dispatch` (Parallel agent dispatch with model-aware routing), `execute` (Execution engine for Scaffold plans), `loop-guard` (Detect and recover from Claude stopping mid-task), and 16 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `Stop`, `PostToolUse`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scaffold@claude-community` from `alexxenn/scaffold`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 3,
    "command": 24
  },
